WEBVTT

00:05.650 --> 00:08.900
Four days in Okinawa?!

00:08.900 --> 00:10.760
I can't wait!

00:10.760 --> 00:13.950
Okinawa soba, goya chanpuru, awamori!

00:13.950 --> 00:16.410
Oh, right! I better buy a swimsuit, too!

00:16.410 --> 00:19.450
It's a <i>training</i> retreat, remember?

00:20.160 --> 00:22.030
Believe me, I know!

00:22.030 --> 00:24.900
But what we do in the evenings
is up to us, right?

00:25.550 --> 00:26.770
Hey, Fuyutsuki-san!

00:26.770 --> 00:29.580
Wanna go swimsuit shopping with me?

00:31.860 --> 00:34.390
Oh. I suppose.

00:36.050 --> 00:37.720
Again?

00:37.720 --> 00:38.720
Yes.

00:46.090 --> 00:48.440
Himuro-kun. What's the matter?

00:48.910 --> 00:50.410
Fuyutsuki-san.

00:50.850 --> 00:51.900
Well...

00:51.900 --> 00:55.950
I get so anxious when I think
about the retreat and Okinawa.

00:55.950 --> 00:59.850
Is it about how hot Okinawa is?

00:59.850 --> 01:03.280
No, it's not so bad in spring.

01:03.840 --> 01:06.010
It's a psychological issue.

01:09.020 --> 01:10.460
Psychological?

01:10.460 --> 01:15.890
A south-seas resort.
The blue ocean. A white beach.

01:15.890 --> 01:20.860
Being in that situation
will get me so excited,

01:20.860 --> 01:23.620
I'll summon a raging winter storm.

01:23.620 --> 01:25.480
I'm not sure if I can go.

01:27.800 --> 01:30.640
But since it's a training retreat,

01:30.640 --> 01:32.410
I can't just skip it.

01:32.870 --> 01:34.940
What on earth am I going to do?

01:37.540 --> 01:39.950
I'd love to sit on a southern beach,

01:39.950 --> 01:43.950
enjoying the quiet sound
of the waves, but...

01:49.960 --> 01:52.620
There must be a way.

01:53.190 --> 01:55.370
Right, Nyamero?

01:57.050 --> 01:59.010
<b>The Ice Guy and</b>

02:00.550 --> 02:02.180
<b>His Cool Female Colleague</b>

02:06.890 --> 02:09.850
<b>Episode 2</b>

03:28.840 --> 03:29.980
Himuro-kun.

03:33.460 --> 03:37.730
It's just homemade,
but you can have it if you want.

03:37.730 --> 03:39.170
What is this?

03:39.170 --> 03:40.750
Shake it side to side.

03:44.240 --> 03:45.930
The sound of the waves?

03:45.930 --> 03:47.510
It's a surf drum.

03:47.980 --> 03:49.500
Surf drum?

03:49.980 --> 03:50.910
Yes.

03:50.910 --> 03:52.800
It's an instrument you fill
with stones or dried beans,

03:52.800 --> 03:55.160
and it simulates the sound of the waves.

03:57.270 --> 04:00.820
You can use it to acclimate yourself
to the sound of the waves.

04:00.820 --> 04:05.790
They also say the sound of
waves can be calming.

04:05.790 --> 04:07.760
Calming?

04:07.760 --> 04:10.610
So if you use it to train,

04:10.610 --> 04:13.760
you might be able to go to Okinawa
without causing a blizzard.

04:14.810 --> 04:16.270
The training retreat...

04:16.990 --> 04:20.230
I'd miss you if you didn't go.

04:20.230 --> 04:22.280
I hope you'll find a way to come along.

04:24.280 --> 04:25.290
Goodbye.

04:28.220 --> 04:29.290
<i>N-N...</i>

04:29.290 --> 04:31.390
<i>N-No freakin' way!</i>

04:33.260 --> 04:34.290
<i>I love you!</i>

04:35.090 --> 04:37.380
<i>She'd miss me if I don't go?</i>

04:37.380 --> 04:38.910
<i>Is this real life?!</i>

04:39.800 --> 04:40.930
Train!

04:41.580 --> 04:43.680
Train for the employee retreat!

04:43.680 --> 04:44.600
Train?

04:44.600 --> 04:47.710
Are you gonna perform
at the employee banquet?

04:59.200 --> 05:00.750
Commence training!

05:07.050 --> 05:10.580
Clear your mind. Be one
with the world around you.

05:11.740 --> 05:14.620
You're okay. You'll be okay!

05:20.460 --> 05:21.590
Nyamero.

05:22.000 --> 05:24.120
Do you think Himuro-kun can do it?

05:30.600 --> 05:31.920
<b>Tons of Fun!</b>

05:30.600 --> 05:33.600
<b></b>Sightseeing Guide

05:30.600 --> 05:33.600
<b>Heavenly Activities</b>

06:16.890 --> 06:20.900
<b>Mensore</b>

06:28.130 --> 06:29.910
The beach! Awesome!

06:31.910 --> 06:34.930
How are you doing, Himuro-kun?

06:35.820 --> 06:38.180
I feel very confident.

07:00.140 --> 07:02.230
All done!

07:04.960 --> 07:08.880
It's evening, but it's still sunny out!

07:08.880 --> 07:10.740
The days are very long here.

07:10.740 --> 07:13.700
Let's go to the beach! The beach!

07:21.110 --> 07:23.210
It's so cold!

07:23.470 --> 07:25.940
It's April, after all.

07:27.380 --> 07:29.820
Are you all right, Himuro-kun?

07:29.820 --> 07:30.720
Yes.

07:32.720 --> 07:34.620
I'm no fan of the heat,

07:34.620 --> 07:37.970
but as long as I stay out of
the sun, I won't melt.

07:40.440 --> 07:42.980
<i>So he really will melt in the heat?</i>

07:42.980 --> 07:45.880
And I really have to thank you.

07:47.090 --> 07:49.430
That surf drum you gave me...

07:51.100 --> 07:55.090
I trained with it every night
to simulate the sound of the waves

07:55.090 --> 07:57.490
and now I can look at the sea with calm.

07:58.320 --> 08:02.000
<i>No freakin' way am I startin' any blizzards!</i>

08:02.000 --> 08:03.650
I'm glad to hear it.

08:03.650 --> 08:07.070
Is this your first time in
Okinawa, Fuyutsuki-san?

08:07.070 --> 08:10.120
No, I came on a school field trip once.

08:10.120 --> 08:12.010
Oh, really?

08:12.510 --> 08:16.040
A typhoon made it impossible
to leave the hotel.

08:16.040 --> 08:17.930
We were stuck there the whole time.

08:19.360 --> 08:20.890
That's a shame.

08:22.280 --> 08:25.520
So I've really been looking forward to this.

08:28.160 --> 08:31.790
I did some research and
made up a travel guidebook.

08:31.790 --> 08:33.030
Travel guidebook?

08:33.030 --> 08:35.030
<b></b>Okinawa Employee Retreat
<b>Travel Guidebook</b>

08:35.740 --> 08:38.030
Would you like to use it?

08:40.490 --> 08:41.770
I'd love to.

08:45.720 --> 08:47.780
<i>She put a ton of effort into this!</i>

08:48.850 --> 08:56.050
<i>She doesn't show it, but she really
was lookin' forward to this...</i>

08:56.910 --> 09:01.610
<i>I'm gonna enjoy the heck outta
Okinawa with Fuyutsuki-sanâ€”</i>

09:01.610 --> 09:03.060
<i>Oh, crud!</i>

09:03.510 --> 09:05.340
Almost blew it there!

09:05.340 --> 09:09.080
Himuro-kun, your Kansai
accent sometimes comes out.

09:09.080 --> 09:11.430
Oh, yes, I guess it does.

09:20.570 --> 09:23.080
<i>She get good news or somethin'?</i>

09:23.780 --> 09:25.100
Look.

09:25.720 --> 09:27.550
S-So cute!

09:28.590 --> 09:31.410
The petsitter sent it to me.

09:31.410 --> 09:34.430
I see. You have someone
looking after your cat?

09:34.430 --> 09:39.080
Yes. They're very nice,
and Nyamero really likes them.

09:39.080 --> 09:40.240
Nyamero?

09:40.240 --> 09:41.510
Oh, that's your cat's...

09:41.510 --> 09:42.600
My cat's name.

09:42.990 --> 09:45.930
Nyamero's a darn cute name.

09:45.930 --> 09:47.150
Yes.

09:47.150 --> 09:49.100
And...

09:50.910 --> 09:52.770
I sure do love Nyamero.

09:56.540 --> 09:59.390
Wait, did I get the intonation wrong?

10:02.430 --> 10:05.370
It's hard to speak with a Kansai accent.

10:05.370 --> 10:06.930
<i>Freakin' cute!</i>

10:06.930 --> 10:08.730
<i>I... I...</i>

10:08.730 --> 10:12.130
<i>I freakin' love that side of Fuyutsuki-san!</i>

10:15.040 --> 10:16.690
<i>That was close!</i>

10:18.660 --> 10:20.640
<i>I gotta stay cool,</i>

10:20.640 --> 10:21.710
Gotcha!

10:21.710 --> 10:22.970
Darn it!

10:21.710 --> 10:23.610
<i>and make it through this trip!</i>

10:33.010 --> 10:34.520
<i>Stay quiet.</i>

10:35.910 --> 10:37.140
<i>Composed.</i>

10:38.340 --> 10:39.610
<i>Unobtrusive.</i>

10:46.450 --> 10:47.750
<i>Shisa lions.</i>

10:49.750 --> 10:52.040
<i>I'll buy the cutest one.</i>

10:52.920 --> 10:54.090
<i>This one.</i>

10:55.090 --> 11:10.060
<b>Shisa</b>

10:57.050 --> 11:00.420
I'm sorry. You can have it, Himuro-kun.

11:00.420 --> 11:03.360
No, you were here first, Fuyutsuki-san.

11:05.830 --> 11:06.940
Well, then...

11:06.940 --> 11:07.860
Take it.

11:08.510 --> 11:09.420
All right.

11:12.210 --> 11:16.060
I'll help you choose one
of your own in exchange.

11:20.600 --> 11:23.070
This one's cute, isn't it?

11:25.420 --> 11:27.080
<i>So cute.</i>

11:27.080 --> 11:28.090
<i></i>You<i> are, that is!</i>

11:29.550 --> 11:31.080
<i>C-Crud!</i>

11:32.990 --> 11:33.850
Snow?

11:36.610 --> 11:38.570
In spring, in Okinawa?

11:38.570 --> 11:40.770
Is it artificial, for the tourists?

11:41.760 --> 11:44.930
It's so pretty! What a memory to make!

11:46.100 --> 11:49.100
<b>Souvenirs</b>

11:54.550 --> 11:56.750
Well done, Himuro-kun.

11:58.150 --> 11:59.480
It was nothing, really.

12:07.750 --> 12:09.620
<i>It'll be another great day tomorrow.</i>

12:16.290 --> 12:20.180
<i>Is it all right for a man to be this happy?</i>

12:25.300 --> 12:27.960
<i>Next, the weather!</i>

12:29.000 --> 12:33.010
<i>The weather in the Okinawa
has been mild up until now,</i>

12:33.010 --> 12:36.020
<i>but we're about to see a big change,
with temperatures rising today.</i>

12:36.020 --> 12:41.530
<b>Hottest in History</b>

12:36.020 --> 12:41.530
<b>Miyako</b>

12:36.020 --> 12:41.530
<b>Kume</b>

12:36.020 --> 12:41.530
<b>Nago</b>

12:36.020 --> 12:41.530
<b>Yonaguni</b>

12:36.020 --> 12:41.530
<b>Naha</b>

12:36.020 --> 12:41.530
<b>Daito</b>

12:36.020 --> 12:41.530
<b>Watch out for heatstroke!!</b>

12:36.020 --> 12:41.530
<i>We'll be seeing summer-like temperatures,
a record for this time of year!</i>

12:52.200 --> 12:54.500
<i>Summer-like?! That's freakin' bad!</i>

12:54.500 --> 12:56.440
What's the matter?

12:56.440 --> 12:58.000
Oh, nothing...

12:58.410 --> 13:00.320
I'm heading to the store!

13:03.860 --> 13:04.830
Himuro-san?

13:04.830 --> 13:06.510
I'll see you at breakfast!

13:07.580 --> 13:09.510
<i>Bad... Very bad!</i>

13:09.510 --> 13:12.100
<i>I ain't gonna last in summer heat!</i>

13:17.650 --> 13:26.660
<b>Out of Order</b>

13:17.940 --> 13:21.080
No ice or ice cream?

13:21.080 --> 13:23.680
I'm sorry, the freezer broke all of a sudden.

13:23.680 --> 13:26.660
The repair man will be here
before noon, though.

13:26.660 --> 13:28.900
<i>That'll be too late, darn it!</i>

13:28.900 --> 13:32.790
I see. Are there any
other shops in the hotel?

13:32.790 --> 13:35.020
I'm afraid not.

13:38.920 --> 13:41.080
Let's pack it in!

13:41.080 --> 13:42.400
Yes, let's.

13:44.150 --> 13:46.100
Um, is Himuro-kun here?

13:47.190 --> 13:50.990
He actually dashed out, saying
he was going to the shop.

13:50.990 --> 13:52.620
Haven't heard from him since.

13:53.650 --> 13:57.200
He heard today's weather
report and freaked out.

14:02.100 --> 14:04.660
Himuro-kun. Where have you gone?

14:05.440 --> 14:09.450
<b>Address Book</b>

14:05.440 --> 14:09.450
<b>Hasegawa-san</b>

14:05.440 --> 14:09.450
<b>Hatada-san</b>

14:05.440 --> 14:09.450
<b>Hosoyama Megu-san</b>

14:05.440 --> 14:09.450
<b>Mikawa Moe-san</b>

14:05.440 --> 14:09.450
<b>Muto-san</b>

14:05.440 --> 14:09.450
<b>Morimoto-san</b>

14:05.440 --> 14:09.450
<b>Yashio-san</b>

14:05.440 --> 14:09.450
<i>I don't have his contact information.</i>

14:09.450 --> 14:13.200
But as long as I stay out of
the sun, I won't melt.

14:13.200 --> 14:15.510
It's a lot hotter today.

14:16.040 --> 14:21.710
<i>Could he really out there
somewhere, melting?</i>

14:22.700 --> 14:24.960
<i>Or did he go inside the hotel
because it's hot?</i>

14:28.190 --> 14:30.140
<i>A cold wind...</i>

14:30.140 --> 14:31.500
Himuro-kun?

14:32.890 --> 14:33.970
Himuro-kun?

14:34.370 --> 14:35.920
Fuyutsuki-san.

14:35.920 --> 14:37.090
Over here.

14:38.940 --> 14:40.080
Right here.

14:46.900 --> 14:48.400
Himuro-kun?

14:49.240 --> 14:52.200
You've shrunk quite a bit.

14:52.200 --> 14:55.050
When it's hot, I melt and shrink.

14:55.650 --> 14:58.620
I didn't expect it to turn
summer-like so suddenly.

15:00.360 --> 15:03.510
I thought I could use ice
from the shop to cool off,

15:03.510 --> 15:05.920
but their freezer had malfunctioned.

15:07.430 --> 15:10.210
I can't attend the training like this.

15:10.210 --> 15:11.520
And...

15:11.520 --> 15:14.680
If this goes on, I'll just keep melting.

15:14.680 --> 15:15.950
You'll be all right.

15:17.950 --> 15:19.270
Fuyutsuki-san...

15:19.750 --> 15:21.860
Cooling off will return you
to normal, right?

15:21.860 --> 15:22.950
Yes!

15:22.950 --> 15:23.790
But...

15:24.610 --> 15:28.080
I looked into where the nearest convenience
store is, and it's two kilometers away...

15:28.080 --> 15:29.280
You'll be all right.

15:30.830 --> 15:32.280
Wait for me.

15:34.500 --> 15:35.990
Fuyutsuki-san!

15:37.600 --> 15:39.640
<i>Two kilometers to the convenience store...</i>

15:39.640 --> 15:41.880
<i>Can Fuyutsuki-san handle it?</i>

15:49.500 --> 15:50.950
Sorry for the wait.

15:55.550 --> 15:57.810
Eat this.

15:57.810 --> 16:00.330
How did you get back so fast?

16:00.330 --> 16:01.460
The convenience store's...

16:01.460 --> 16:03.080
It's not from the convenience store.

16:03.080 --> 16:05.400
It's a dessert from the breakfast buffet.

16:07.720 --> 16:09.820
<i>She's so darn smart!</i>

16:09.820 --> 16:11.600
Will this handle it?

16:11.600 --> 16:13.850
Yes. Thank you.

16:28.520 --> 16:30.840
Um... what is it?

16:30.840 --> 16:32.380
Himuro-kun.

16:32.380 --> 16:34.840
You're always taller than me.

16:35.230 --> 16:37.940
You're very cute
when you're small like this.

16:39.600 --> 16:40.810
Hey...

16:40.810 --> 16:44.240
I suppose that's not flattering
for an adult man to hear.

16:44.990 --> 16:46.280
I'm sorry.

16:51.220 --> 16:54.690
But you're so cute, I'd like
to pat you on the head.

16:54.690 --> 16:56.610
R-Really?

16:58.170 --> 17:00.620
Would you mind if I patted your head?

17:02.610 --> 17:04.190
G-Go ahead.

17:13.550 --> 17:15.330
<i>Himuro-kun's hair...</i>

17:17.080 --> 17:19.880
<i>It's so sleek and cool.</i>

17:28.540 --> 17:29.850
I'm back.

17:29.850 --> 17:31.790
The ice pop worked.

17:31.790 --> 17:32.890
Fuyutsuki-san.

17:32.890 --> 17:33.900
Thank yâ€”

17:35.380 --> 17:37.910
You startled me.

17:40.910 --> 17:45.110
W-We'd better get back and eat breakfast.

17:45.630 --> 17:47.930
R-Right.

17:49.420 --> 17:54.640
When handling a client that's
claiming damaged merchandise,

17:58.430 --> 18:02.930
if they aren't satisfied
with your response,

17:58.970 --> 18:02.930
<i>I feel so much more nervous
around the usual him.</i>

18:02.930 --> 18:08.940
they'll definitely file a complaint about it.

18:15.790 --> 18:18.950
<i>Can the descendant of
a snow woman get fevers?</i>

18:19.530 --> 18:23.950
Wonderful work at your training,
my fine new employees.

18:23.950 --> 18:27.270
Please help yourselves to food and drink.

18:28.200 --> 18:29.460
And so...

18:29.750 --> 18:31.910
Cheers!

18:44.050 --> 18:46.980
Training retreats are the best!

18:47.580 --> 18:50.480
I have just one regret, though...

18:50.480 --> 18:51.690
Regret?

18:52.860 --> 19:00.360
<b>Fireworks Festival</b>

18:53.260 --> 18:56.230
Yeah, there's a fireworks festival today.

18:56.230 --> 19:00.360
But we'd be too late to reserve
a good spot at this point.

19:00.360 --> 19:02.120
I wanted to see them!

19:05.740 --> 19:08.130
See you tomorrow!

19:11.460 --> 19:14.500
Wanna catch a taxi back to the hotel?

19:14.500 --> 19:15.630
Excuse me.

19:16.360 --> 19:19.630
Could we take a little detour, do you think?

19:20.510 --> 19:21.750
A little detour?

19:27.640 --> 19:30.560
This is more than a <i>little</i> detour!

19:30.560 --> 19:31.770
Agreed.

19:32.260 --> 19:33.910
How much further do we go?

19:33.910 --> 19:35.360
Just a bit.

19:38.080 --> 19:39.780
That sounds like...

19:45.060 --> 19:46.280
Awesome!

19:46.280 --> 19:49.290
How did you know about
this place, Fuyutsuki-san?

19:49.930 --> 19:52.830
I found it while researching
my travel guidebook.

19:52.830 --> 19:55.290
It's a little local secret.

20:00.790 --> 20:03.300
<i>Darn smart thinkin', Fuyutsuki-san!</i>

20:03.300 --> 20:04.890
Travel guidebook?

20:04.890 --> 20:06.410
I wanna see!

20:08.900 --> 20:10.310
Gotta take a pic!

20:14.900 --> 20:16.740
Look this way, everyone!

20:40.280 --> 20:42.150
<i>I hope it came out okay.</i>

20:45.210 --> 20:46.490
<i>Himuro-kun?</i>

20:50.030 --> 20:51.140
<i>From this morning...</i>

20:55.860 --> 20:59.770
<i>This picture will be my little secret.</i>

21:07.140 --> 21:09.660
<i>I hope I can come back here
with Fuyutsuki-san next year</i>

21:10.120 --> 21:12.220
<i>and watch the fireworks again!</i>

22:52.840 --> 22:56.220
You all did excellent work.

22:57.700 --> 23:00.230
You've made this
a wonderful training retreat.

23:00.230 --> 23:03.710
If you find yourself struggling
with work in the future,

23:00.980 --> 23:03.990
<i>It sure was a great retreat.</i>

23:03.710 --> 23:06.130
I hope you look back on these lessons.

23:03.990 --> 23:06.790
<i>I made a heckuva lot
of memories with Fuyutsuki-san!</i>

23:07.360 --> 23:09.710
We'll be heading back to Tokyo now.

23:09.710 --> 23:13.040
You'll be back to a very different
world than here in Okinawa.

23:09.720 --> 23:13.650
<i>And when we get back to Tokyo,
we'll be making a heckuva lot more!</i>

23:13.650 --> 23:14.740
<i>We sure will!</i>

23:14.740 --> 23:17.920
You've been in temporary assignments so far,

23:17.920 --> 23:21.630
but your permanent assignments will be
announced at the beginning of the week.

23:21.630 --> 23:23.550
Even if we're assigned to different areas,

23:23.550 --> 23:25.250
we remain a united whole.

23:25.710 --> 23:28.090
Your worries are my worries.

23:25.710 --> 23:30.550
It'd be a real bummer to be torn apart
after we've become friends and all!

23:28.090 --> 23:31.570
Your enjoyment is my enjoyment.

23:30.550 --> 23:31.890
Yes, it would.

23:31.570 --> 23:34.740
Let's continue growing together
without wasting a single moment.

23:32.220 --> 23:33.750
What?!

23:34.740 --> 23:38.240
<i>I might be... separated from Fuyutsuki-san?!</i>
